      "body": "## Motivation\n\nNemotron wrappers read nested Puzzle models as regular Nemotron configs, losing per-layer expert settings and causing weight-loading failures.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse the existing Puzzle config class and prevent serialization from constructing an empty Puzzle config. Add regression tests while preserving ordinary Nemotron behavior.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- All five config tests pass; the new regression fails before the fix and passes after.\n- Live smoke test on this branch with `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB-BF16` in Docker on 2×H100 (TP=2): model loaded successfully and three chat requests passed with expected output.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot run.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit. Changed-file checks pass; repository-wide Rust hooks require unavailable cargo/rustup tools.\n- [x] Add unit tests.\n- [x] Update documentation — not needed for this fix.\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmarks.\n- [x] Follow SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39209011290](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39209011290)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39209011242](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39209011242)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39209011271](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39209011271)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
